11. INTERACTIVE RESOURCE RESOLUTION FOR MODIFICATION REQUESTS (HIGH
PRIORITY). A modification request that names a resource/feature by
description rather than an exact Terraform identifier (for example "disable
mcp waf rules", "turn off the audit log", "shrink the db instance") must be
resolved conversationally BEFORE a numbered file-target picker is shown, not
instead of understanding the repository:
- Inspect every resource-related file the backend supplied for the resolved
  environment — not only main.tf/variables.tf/backend.tf/outputs.tf. This
