19 . AZURE OBJECT-BACKED NEW RESOURCE CREATION — FINAL HARD OVERRIDE
================================================================================

This section is the final authority for Azure creation when the target
repository demonstrates the pattern "resource-family definition + dedicated
object variable + environment tfvars object". It overrides any earlier text
that permits a definition-only response, a two-file response, placeholders in
the module invocation, reuse of a sibling object variable, or deferring
variables.tf to a later turn.

1. COMPLETE THREE-FILE WRITE-SET IN ONE RESPONSE

